# Title -> lobby -> cartridge check screen (no Transfer Pak) -> C-Right: the Options menu (rows サウンド, じっきょう,
# バックアップ, おわり; the cursor wraps). Toggles Sound and Commentary, answers both Backup questions (B on the first,
# はい then B on the second), leaves with おわり (saves the flags) and reopens, toggles back and leaves with B (discards),
# clears the save with はい/はい, then B on the cartridge screen back to the title and in again.
@window 12 160
1200 START 140 shot:lobby 160 shot:cart_none
CR 40 shot:options_menu
DOWN 20 shot:row_commentary DOWN 20 shot:row_backup DOWN 20 shot:row_exit DOWN 20 shot:row_wrap_sound UP 20 shot:row_wrap_up
DOWN 20 A 20 shot:sound_mono DOWN 20 A 20 shot:commentary_off
DOWN 20 A 30 shot:clear_ask1 RIGHT 20 shot:clear_ask1_toggle B 30 shot:clear_cancelled
A 30 LEFT 20 shot:clear_ask1_yes A 30 shot:clear_ask2 B 30 shot:clear_ask2_cancelled
DOWN 20 A 60 shot:options_saved CR 40 shot:options_reopened
A 20 DOWN 20 A 20 shot:toggled_back B 60 shot:options_discarded CR 40 shot:options_after_discard
DOWN 20 DOWN 20 A 30 LEFT 20 A 30 LEFT 20 A 60 shot:clear_done B 60 shot:cart_after_clear
B 120 shot:exit_to_title 200 shot:title_back 300 shot:title_back_idle
START 140 shot:lobby_again 160 shot:cart_again
